//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/mb04/0140370a00'>
//「お前が俺を斬るなら、それでもいい」
"Kill me, Ichijo, if that is your will."

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/mb04/0140380a00'>
//「お前の正義に、俺の答えを返す事が、俺に
//残された最後の役割だ。
//　それさえ果たせればいい」
"I had a duty to answer your question. My final duty, and now it is done."

pt:
//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/mb04/0140370a00'>
//「お前が俺を斬るなら、それでもいい」
"Mate-me, Ichijo, se for essa a sua vontade."

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/mb04/0140380a00'>
//「お前の正義に、俺の答えを返す事が、俺に
//残された最後の役割だ。
//　それさえ果たせればいい」
"Eu tinha o dever de responder à sua pergunta. Meu último dever, e agora está cumprido."

en:
//【一条】
<voice name='一条' class='一条' src='voice/mb04/0140390a02'>
//「……」
"......"

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/mb04/0140400a00'>
//「俺はお前の正義を認めている。
//　その俺を斬れ」
"So kill me. But know, as you do, that I believe in you. I believe that you are right."

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/mb04/0140410a00'>
//「俺をお前の正義だと思って斬れ。
//　戦いの矛盾と醜さを知れ」
"See in me your justice, your idea of good, as you drive your blade through my flesh. And know, thereby, the horror and folly inherent in any battle."

pt:
