"When you hold your deeds up and say㉒<I>this was right,</I> you make other people believe it too. You make them believe that it is good to kill those they deem evil.
  Don't you see? You, Masamune's Chosen, have the power to㉓<i>inspire.</I>"

pt:
//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/mb04/0140580a00'>
